    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a36">

                <pb facs="0571" n="521" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg521"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 36.—From the legation of Portugal at
                        Rio Janeiro.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-12"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 12,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Brazilian Government is informed that some refugees have disembarked at
                    Buenos Ayres. If this news is confirmed diplomatic negotiations will probably be
                    broken off.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paraty.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
